# Sovereign Okinec Ahau (3/4, Ward {2}; "whenever it attacks, for each creature you control with power greater than that creature's
# base power, put a number of +1/+1 counters on that creature equal to the difference"). Turn 1: Okinec is cast for {2}{W}{G} (Mox Pearl,
# Mox Emerald, the Forest and Mox Jet, the pool empty after) with an Ornithopter (0/2) beside it. Turn 3, in the beginning of combat: Bot1
# gives Okinec and the Ornithopter Giant Growth (+3/+3 until end of turn), and Bot2 gives its own Ornithopter Giant Growth (power 3, base 0).
# Okinec attacks alone: the Ornithopter is not attacking, but the trigger reads every creature Bot1 controls. Okinec (power 6, base 3) and
# Bot1's Ornithopter (power 3, base 0) each get three +1/+1 counters; Bot2's boosted Ornithopter gets none ("you control").
# CR 122.1, 208.1, 613.4c, 603.2.

